[ti:Visitor song]
[ar:nishal21 and visitors]
[00:00.00]Someone stopped by late on a quiet night
[00:05.12]left a single note and went on their way
[00:09.20]I never got their name until the credits
[00:15.70]now it plays here every single day
[00:20.06]I was painting a picture (@nishal21)
[00:23.46]One note at a time
[00:27.66]from people passing through
[00:32.74]a name beside a line
[00:38.26]and part of it is you
[00:42.26]Leave yours and the song gets one beat longer
